# Provisions Merchant: "When this creature enters, create a Food token" (CR 111.10b) and "Whenever this creature attacks, you may sacrifice a Food. If you do,
# attacking creatures get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn" (CR 701.21a, 608.2c, 611.2c). Turn 1: a Black Lotus and a Forest pay for the Merchant (a Memnite
# comes first); a Food token arrives. Turn 3: both creatures attack, Bot1 sacrifices the Food and both get +1/+1 and trample; nothing is paid as a cost.
# Memnite, an artifact but no Food, is not offered for the sacrifice.
